# app/firefox-extension.xpi is deliberately NOT ignored. It's a signed
# build artifact, but CI builds the app from a clean checkout and never
# runs extension/build.sh — so if it isn't committed, every released
# build ships without the extension and Settings -> Routing -> Install
# reports it as missing.
